e second  part was how to get them excited about  your business and I think the real thing  that comes through is your own  excitement you know I love  entrepreneurship I love helping  entrepreneurs when I'm sitting in front  of an entrepreneur there's an energy  that I get I want to help them out I  want to find a way to go their business  even talking about it now I'm getting  excited that's what I love doing and so  if you're excited about whatever  business you have that's going to come  through  other people will get excited and  although they'll catch your fever if  you're just going through your pitch and  you know some people come and I was  pitched recently with this guy had a  kind of like a PowerPoint but he had it  written down so instead of using the  computer he brought two binders and he  went through one and I went through one  it was it was just born because he's  just reading his slides that's not great  like that's not showing passion we'd be  great information great value maybe a  great ideas in there for me but I want  to see your passion and excitement and  it's not so much what you say it's how  you say it and if people genuinely sense  that you're excited about this  opportunity then they'll get more  excited as well so it really starts with  you having something that you are  genuinely excited about so when you're  starting the business you want to build  it around something you are passionate  about something that you can wake up and  get going every morning not maybe every  morning because I know it can be hard  but almost every morning you wake up  excited to go and do what you're doing  that passion will come through and other  people will want to join with you on  whatever you're passionate about if  you're just doing it to make money or  you just go through the motions and  you're not really excited if you don't  personally use your product or service  and you can't tell a personal story  about why you started it or while you're  involved in the business then it's gonna  be a lot harder to get people excited  about it even if you have the best case  studies in the world so hopefully that  helped maybe a little bit different  about how I approach it compared to  others but hopefully some information  there that can help you with your  business so thanks for the question  for those of you watching if you liked  it please give it a thumbs up I love  seeing them come in and if you have a  question about this video or question  about your own company or challenge that  you're facing feel free leave in the  comment section below I always read  those I love seeing them come in so  thank you and I'll see you on the next  episode
 

